[Desktop Entry]
Name=Ultra Save Mode (Toggle)
Name[ko]=초절전 모드 (토글)
Name[ja]=極限省電力モード (トグル)
Name[zh_CN]=极限超省电模式 (切换)
Name[zh_TW]=極限超省電模式 (切換)
Name[es]=Modo Ultra Ahorro (Alternar)
Name[de]=Ultra-Energiesparmodus (Umschalten)
Name[fr]=Mode Ultra Économie (Basculer)
Name[ru]=Режим экстремального энергосбережения (Переключить)
Name[it]=Modalità Ultra Risparmio (Attiva/Disattiva)
Name[pt]=Modo Ultra Economia (Alternar)
Comment=Toggle ThinkPower Ultra Power Saver Mode (Keeps Wi-Fi and Bluetooth)
Comment[ko]=초절전 모드 켜기/끄기 (Wi-Fi, 블루투스 유지)
Comment[ja]=極限省電力モードの切替 (Wi-Fi・Bluetooth維持)
Comment[zh_CN]=切换极限超省电模式 (保持Wi-Fi和蓝牙连接)
Comment[zh_TW]=切換極限超省電模式 (維持Wi-Fi和藍牙連線)
Comment[es]=Alternar modo ultra ahorro (Mantiene Wi-Fi y Bluetooth)
Comment[de]=Ultra-Energiesparmodus umschalten (WLAN und Bluetooth bleiben aktiv)
Comment[fr]=Basculer en mode ultra économie (Maintient Wi-Fi et Bluetooth)
Comment[ru]=Переключение экстремального энергосбережения (Wi-Fi и BT активны)
Comment[it]=Attiva/Disattiva modalità ultra risparmio (Wi-Fi e BT attivi)
Comment[pt]=Alternar modo ultra economia (Mantém Wi-Fi e Bluetooth)
Exec=/usr/bin/power-profile-manager toggle
Icon=battery-low
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=System;Settings;Utility;
Keywords=power;battery;saver;ultra;energy;전원;배터리;절전;초절전;省電力;节电;
StartupNotify=false
